    "Public AMD surface capabilities, graphics-only present queue, FIFO and MAILBOX, exact/fullscreen extents and VkImage swapchain alias/binding. UNORM8, FP16/scRGB and HDR10 flow through actual Desktop composition/output/capture; resize/output replacement/reset retain generations and return BO budgets to baseline.",
